  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FORGE  REQUIRES-1e2a41?labelColor=gray&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/KOTLIN FOR FORGE-blue?logo=kotlin&labelColor=gray&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CREATE-ae7c38?logo=curseforge&labelColor=gray&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FABRIC REQUIRES-c6bca5?labelColor=gray&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FABRIC LANGUAGE KOTLIN-blue?logo=kotlin&labelColor=gray&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CREATE FABRIC-ae7c38?logo=curseforge&labelColor=gray&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>使用黃銅，你可以將銅製背包升級為噴氣背包，\n利用內部的壓縮空氣推動你在空中飛行。</p>\n<p>靈感來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-jetpacks-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Jetpacks</a>，\n這款噴氣背包還具備懸停模式。</p>\n<p>與銅製背包一樣，噴氣背包也可以裝備在胸甲欄位，\n能為長柄鉗等物品提供空氣，並且可以附魔 <em>容量</em>。\n就像背包一樣，將其放置於地面並輸入旋轉力即可充電。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PssbleTrngle/CreateJetpack/1.18.x/screenshots/usage.png\" alt=\"用法\"></p>\n<p>在水下衝刺游泳時，噴氣背包會提升你的游泳速度。\n此外，懸停模式可防止你向下沉沒。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PssbleTrngle/CreateJetpack/1.18.x/screenshots/underwater.png\" alt=\"水下用法\"></p>\n<p>如果安裝了類似 <a href=\"https://github.com/illusivesoulworks/elytraslot\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elytra Slot</a> 的模組，\n該模組允許在穿戴胸甲的同時裝備鞘翅，\n則當玩家按住 <code>UP</code> 鍵時，噴氣背包會提供類似煙火的推進力。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PssbleTrngle/CreateJetpack/1.18.x/screenshots/elytra.png\" alt=\"鞘翅支援\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
